{"seq":2,"slug":"aperture-synthesis-vlbi","title":"综合孔径与 VLBI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/radio-astronomy/interferometry/aperture-synthesis-vlbi","wordCount":1714,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"综合孔径与-vlbi\">综合孔径与 VLBI</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><a href=\"interferometry-principles\">干涉测量原理</a>证明了每条基线在某一时刻只采样 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u,v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 平面上一个点。但一张图像需要成千上万个采样点，难道要造成千上万条基线？综合孔径技术给出了优雅的答案：让地球替你转。地球自转使每条基线的投影 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u,v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 随时间画出一条椭圆轨迹，几小时下来，少数几条基线就能扫出稠密的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u,v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 覆盖，等效合成一面巨大口径。把这套思想推到极致——天线散布到全球甚至全地球——就是甚长基线干涉（VLBI），它让人类拍下了黑洞的影子。这一篇讲清楚综合孔径与 VLBI 如何把稀疏基线变成超高分辨率的成像能力。</p>\n<p>综合孔径的核心是用时间换基线：地球自转 + 多频段观测把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u,v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 平面填满。VLBI 则是综合孔径在洲际/全球尺度上的极端版本，靠原子钟和事后相关把独立台站焊成一台地球大小的望远镜。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[少数基线] --&gt; B[地球自转]&#10;  B --&gt; C[uv 轨迹画椭圆]&#10;  C --&gt; D[稠密 uv 覆盖]&#10;  D --&gt; E[等效大口径]&#10;  A --&gt; F[VLBI:洲际台站]&#10;  F --&gt; G[各站原子钟&lt;br/&gt;独立记录]&#10;  G --&gt; H[事后相关处理]&#10;  H --&gt; I[毫/微角秒分辨率]&#10;  E --&gt; J[傅里叶反变换成像]&#10;  I --&gt; J\">flowchart TD\n  A[少数基线] --&gt; B[地球自转]\n  B --&gt; C[uv 轨迹画椭圆]\n  C --&gt; D[稠密 uv 覆盖]\n  D --&gt; E[等效大口径]\n  A --&gt; F[VLBI:洲际台站]\n  F --&gt; G[各站原子钟&lt;br/&gt;独立记录]\n  G --&gt; H[事后相关处理]\n  H --&gt; I[毫/微角秒分辨率]\n  E --&gt; J[傅里叶反变换成像]\n  I --&gt; J</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>基线尺度</th>\n<th>关键使能技术</th>\n<th>代表成果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>连接式综合孔径</td>\n<td>公里–百公里</td>\n<td>实时光纤传输</td>\n<td>VLA、ALMA、MeerKAT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大陆 VLBI</td>\n<td>千公里</td>\n<td>氢钟、磁盘记录</td>\n<td>EVN、VLBA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全球毫米波 VLBI</td>\n<td>地球直径</td>\n<td>氢钟、相位定标</td>\n<td>EHT 黑洞成像</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"地球自转综合孔径\">地球自转综合孔径</h2><p>固定的一对天线，其基线矢量在天上不动，但相对源的投影 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u,v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 却因地球自转而连续变化。把基线投影到与源方向垂直的平面上，随着地球转动，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u,v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 点描出一段椭圆弧。观测持续几个小时，这条弧就把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u,v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 平面上一大片区域采样了一遍——这就是 Martin Ryle 因之获诺贝尔奖的地球自转综合孔径。</p>\n<p>对一个有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 台天线的阵列，瞬时有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N(N-1)/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 条基线，再乘以地球自转的连续轨迹和多个观测频率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u,v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 覆盖密得惊人。覆盖越密、越均匀，反变换出的图像伪影就越少——这直接决定了下一篇<a href=\"imaging-deconvolution\">成像与去卷积</a>里&quot;脏图&quot;有多脏、去卷积要做多少功。但椭圆轨迹间总有缝隙，覆盖永远不完整，这正是去卷积不可或缺的根本原因。</p>\n<p>值得强调的是：综合孔径只合成了分辨率，没有合成集光面积——阵列的灵敏度仍由总有效面积决定，沿用<a href=\"../telescopes/feeds-aperture\">馈源与口径效率</a>里的 SEFD 标度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 天线把单天线灵敏度改善约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{N(N-1)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 倍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"vlbi-把地球变成一台望远镜\">VLBI：把地球变成一台望远镜</h2><p>当基线长到跨越大洲，实时用电缆或光纤连接天线变得不可能。VLBI 的解法是：每个台站各自用极稳定的氢原子钟打时标，把数据独立记录在高速磁盘上，事后再把全球各站的数据搬到一处&quot;相关器&quot;里对齐相乘。只要各站时间同步精度足够，地球大小的&quot;虚拟口径&quot;就成立了。</p>\n<p>VLBI 的分辨率由地球直径量级的基线给出：在厘米波可达毫角秒，在毫米波更进一步。它把<a href=\"../foundations/radio-sky-sources\">射电天空与源</a>里那些类星体平坦谱核心放大到可分辨喷流根部的程度，也是测量河外天体自行、定义国际天球参考架的基石。技术上的两大命门是相位定标——大气（尤其<a href=\"../foundations/atmosphere-windows\">对流层水汽</a>）造成的快速相位抖动必须靠相位参考源或闭合相位来对付——以及海量数据的相关处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事件视界望远镜-黑洞影像\">事件视界望远镜：黑洞影像</h2><p>VLBI 的巅峰是事件视界望远镜（EHT）。它把分布在智利、夏威夷、南极、西班牙等地的毫米波望远镜（含 ALMA）在 230 GHz 上联成地球大小的阵列，分辨率达约 20 微角秒——足以分辨 M87 与银河系中心黑洞周围的光子环。2019 年的 M87* 影像与 2022 年的人马座 A* 影像，是这套技术的标志性成果。</p>\n<p>EHT 仍在快速演进：2024 年首次实现了 345 GHz 的 VLBI 观测，把分辨率再推进约 50%；2026 年 1 月 EHT 团队发布了对超大质量双黑洞候选体 OJ 287 的分辨偏振观测，绘出其磁场的扭转。下一代事件视界望远镜（ngEHT）计划新增多个台站并升级现有站点支持 86/230/345 GHz 同时观测，目标是把可用于成像的清晰数据量提升约一个数量级——这条升级路线属于本 hub 的<a href=\"../science/ska-future\">SKA 与未来</a>所展望的前沿之一。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>里程碑</th>\n<th>时间</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>M87* 影像</td>\n<td>2019</td>\n<td>首张黑洞影像，230 GHz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sgr A* 影像</td>\n<td>2022</td>\n<td>银心黑洞影像</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>345 GHz VLBI</td>\n<td>2024</td>\n<td>首次实现，分辨率再提升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OJ 287 偏振</td>\n<td>2026.01</td>\n<td>双黑洞候选体磁场扭转</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分辨率与灵敏度的分离\">分辨率与灵敏度的分离</h2><p>综合孔径最容易被误解的一点，是以为它&quot;把望远镜变大了&quot;。其实它合成的只有分辨率，不合成集光面积：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 台天线的灵敏度仍由总有效面积决定，只是在单天线基础上改善约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{N(N-1)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 倍（沿用<a href=\"../telescopes/feeds-aperture\">馈源与口径效率</a>的 SEFD 标度）。换言之，把天线拉得越开，图越锐利，但每一&quot;像素&quot;上收集到的光子并不会因此变多。</p>\n<p>这一分离带来实实在在的工程取舍：为了看清致密结构，需要把天线分散得很远以拉长基线，但这会牺牲短基线、削弱对大尺度弥散结构的响应；为了灵敏地测弱源，又希望集光面积集中、阵列紧凑。现代阵列（如 VLA 的多构型、ALMA 的紧凑/扩展阵型）通过可重构的天线布局在两者间切换，正是为了在同一套设备上覆盖不同科学目标——这也说明 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u,v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 覆盖之所以是成像质量的核心（见<a href=\"imaging-deconvolution\">成像与去卷积</a>），因为它同时编码了分辨率与灵敏度两件事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>综合孔径用地球自转把少数基线的瞬时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u,v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 采样补成稠密轨迹，等效合成大口径分辨率，但不增加集光面积，灵敏度仍由总有效面积（见<a href=\"../telescopes/feeds-aperture\">馈源与口径效率</a>）决定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u,v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 覆盖永远有缝，这正是下一篇<a href=\"imaging-deconvolution\">成像与去卷积</a>中去卷积不可或缺的根源。</li>\n<li>VLBI 用氢钟与事后相关把全球台站焊成地球大小的望远镜，达毫–微角秒分辨率，命门在相位定标（对抗<a href=\"../foundations/atmosphere-windows\">大气水汽</a>）与海量数据相关。</li>\n<li>EHT 在 230/345 GHz 上拍下 M87* 与 Sgr A* 的黑洞影像，2026 年发布 OJ 287 偏振结果，ngEHT 的多频升级是面向<a href=\"../science/ska-future\">未来</a>的前沿。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"综合孔径与 VLBI","id":"综合孔径与-vlbi"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"地球自转综合孔径","id":"地球自转综合孔径"},{"level":2,"text":"VLBI：把地球变成一台望远镜","id":"vlbi-把地球变成一台望远镜"},{"level":2,"text":"事件视界望远镜：黑洞影像","id":"事件视界望远镜-黑洞影像"},{"level":2,"text":"分辨率与灵敏度的分离","id":"分辨率与灵敏度的分离"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"干涉测量原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/radio-astronomy/interferometry/interferometry-principles"},"next":{"title":"成像与去卷积","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/radio-astronomy/interferometry/imaging-deconvolution"}}